    "steps": [
      "Generate five fixed RGBA palettes with deterministic irregular four-pixel blocks.",
      "Assemble forest, dirt, stone, wood and rider detail into one 96 by 64 master atlas.",
      "Export five 32 by 32 runtime tiles from the same source pixels.",
      "Encode all PNG scanlines with filter zero and zlib level nine.",
      "Package every image in qrc and sample runtime tiles with repeat wrapping, nearest magnification, linear minification and mipmaps."
